<title>USA: Omnicare completes Hallmark acquisition.</title>
<headline>Omnicare completes Hallmark acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omnicare Inc said on Tuesady that it has completed its previously announced purchase of Hallmark Medical Co, a privately owned institutional pharmacy provider based in Ridgewood, New Jersey.</p>
</text>
